msgid "Oung Seik Nyan introduces himself as a back-end and full-stack developer. He studied mathematics at Mawlamyine University and shares an interest in computer science, systems programming, and Linux."
msgstr "Oung Seik Nyan introduces himself as a back-end and full-stack developer. He studied mathematics at Mawlamyine University and shares an interest in computer science, systems programming, and Linux."

msgid "Our conversation about the same cross-script naming problem gave me the push to return to YAMU and finish what I had started."
msgstr "Our conversation about the same cross-script naming problem gave me the push to return to YAMU and finish what I had started."

msgid "AhHtet shares photography and illustration through his public creative profiles. He is the parent of the unique Mi Panyun cartoon character and CoonMon Yamu Mon [ကောန်မန်ယၟုမန်] where he contributes Mon names on Facebook. He is a doctor by training with a Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (M.B.B.S.) in Medical Science at the University of Medicine, Magway, Myanmar, from 2009 to 2015."
msgstr "AhHtet shares photography and illustration through his public creative profiles. He is the parent of the unique Mi Panyun cartoon character and CoonMon Yamu Mon [ကောန်မန်ယၟုမန်] where he contributes Mon names on Facebook. He is a doctor by training with a Bachelor of Medicine, Bachelor of Surgery (M.B.B.S.) in Medical Science at the University of Medicine, Magway, Myanmar, from 2009 to 2015."

msgid "Thank you for contributing names in Mon and English, and for sharing the cultural knowledge behind them."
msgstr "Thank you for contributing names in Mon and English, and for sharing the cultural knowledge behind them."

